[*This template generates the "Trans core" theory: only Transc_<nc> and the lemma
  deadlock_free (\<sqinter> n \<in> UNIV. Transc_<nc>\<cdot>n).
  Transc is Trans without the always-enabled branches (share, interrupt, terminate), so this lemma
  checks that in every node some transition is always enabled (complete guards); the full Trans is
  trivially deadlock-free and cannot show this. See Rule 53-1 (createTransitionsCoreAsActionPara) in RC2Z.eol.*]
theory HOLCSP_trans_core_[%=baseName%]_[%=ts%]
	imports "RC_HOL-CSP.RoboChart_Library" HOL.Real
begin

subsection \<open> Model \<close>

